          "path": "_m/g/c/y/e/chillingham-castle-wp/who-designed-lovely-wi.jpg",
          "filename": "Chillingham Castle, Chapel Window (34448467795).jpg",
          "caption": "Who designed this lovely window?\n\nThis ancient and remarkable fortress is the home of Sir Humphry Wakefield Bt., his wife The Hon. Lady Wakefield and their family.  Since 1246 the Castle has been owned by one continuous blood line with the Earls Grey ruling the Castle for the founding centuries.  Those Grey Lords built the Castle’s alarming dungeons and torture chambers, as well as the beautiful parklands and gardens.",
